I used 'standardize = false' because I had normalized the data beforehand.

Here is my `R` code, which I believe is faithful to yours: `a <- b <- 1/2;
N <- 10;
n <- 10^3;

sim <- replicate(10^4, {
  x.a <- rbinom(1, N, a);
  x.b <- rbinom(1, N, b);
  s <- rbeta(n, x.a+1, N+1-x.a) > rbeta(n, x.b+1, N+1-x.b);
  mean(s)
});

hist(sim, breaks=100)`

